# What `railway up` must not try to upload.
#
# `railway up` tars the whole working directory. tmp-pytest/ is a pytest
# scratch dir whose ACLs deny read on Windows, so the compress step aborted
# with "Access is denied. (os error 5)" and the deploy never started. It is
# ignored rather than deleted because nothing here needs it either way.
#
# The rest are the same things .gitignore keeps out — local-only, rebuilt on
# the box, and dead weight in the upload.
tmp-pytest/
.pytest_cache/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
output/
*.log
.git/
tests/
